                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e1b59efb-136b-4d07-9608-7e4dbe39a93f",
                                                "sense_id": "e3e173cf-bcc5-3444-b431-c4d3ed549f45",
                                                "text": "She scrawled the main points onto her notepad."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a86c810f-ad1f-3c43-971f-6de0cdd58eec",
                                        "entry_id": "e112bb63-6f37-3488-b9d7-ea9746ee49c1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To write in an irregular or illegible manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7bd8ca98-4f7f-3920-b1ca-c056e4f343be",
                                        "entry_id": "e112bb63-6f37-3488-b9d7-ea9746ee49c1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To write unskilfully and inelegantly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9474ded3-4a60-47c7-a1ad-905cf733c3ba",
                                                "sense_id": "7bd8ca98-4f7f-3920-b1ca-c056e4f343be",
                                                "text": "c. 1710-1730, Jonathan Swift (probably), Sandys's Ghost\nThough with a golden pen you scrawl."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "scrawl",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "279784ce-c27f-3e5f-bc64-763707e2182f",
                                        "entry_id": "f775df03-2b9e-3ad6-a4fe-9529a4f343c2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To creep; crawl; to move slowly, with difficulty, fearfully, or stealthily."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7a748a46-5846-468f-bef8-3de4d6f6131a",
                                                "sense_id": "279784ce-c27f-3e5f-bc64-763707e2182f",
                                                "text": "we will scrape and scrawl, and catch and pull to us all that we may get"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aafd4654-f5e2-4e52-8f8c-f67b87fba112",
                                                "sense_id": "279784ce-c27f-3e5f-bc64-763707e2182f",
                                                "text": "When I saw him scrawlen on the plain, My heart aw flacker'd for't, I was sae fain."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cd1f7aa4-e11d-4556-827f-bbab34939562",
                                                "sense_id": "279784ce-c27f-3e5f-bc64-763707e2182f",
                                                "text": "T'poor pig what had just scrawled through t'bottom o' t'cart,"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9769f607-d249-4220-a928-0ee8d4c2968e",
                                                "sense_id": "279784ce-c27f-3e5f-bc64-763707e2182f",
                                                "text": "'Cut its throat,' I calls to him, but he didn't, just slashes its forepaw; but it dropt di-rekly, couldn't hardly scrawl out on the bank.'"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
